    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "These stunning 4-bedroom Elm homes offer a unique blend of charming exterior details and an elegant interior that continues the moment you step inside. The render facade adds a touch of sophistication and enhances the curb appeal, making these homes a true standout.\r\n\r\nBoasting a spacious 153 sq. m / 1,647 sq. ft of living space, these A2-rated homes combine modern design with superior energy efficiency, ideal for today’s family lifestyle. The ground floor’s impressive 2.7m ceiling height, amplifies the sense of space.\r\n\r\nUpon entering, you’ll be greeted by a welcoming hallway leading to a spacious living room with a bay window that adds character and creates a perfect place to unwind. The open-plan kitchen/living area is perfect for family meals and social gatherings, with a separate utility room for added storage and convenience. The contemporary kitchen, featuring stylish micro shaker units in a rich spiced carrot finish, is equipped with high-quality integrated appliances.\r\n\r\nEach of the 4 bedrooms comes with full-height built-in wardrobes, offering convenient storage and a sleek, modern finish. Additionally, all bathrooms feature floor and wall tiles and an under-sink storage unit, providing even more functionality and organisation.\r\n\r\nEvery detail in these homes is carefully considered, from the premium finishes to the practical features like a driveway pre-ducted for an EV charger installation.\r\n\r\nStonehaven offers more than just beautiful homes, it’s a vibrant, family-friendly community. The development will feature a Multi-Use Games Area, a playground, dog walking area and a Neighbourhood Centre with a creche and grocery store, adding convenience and enhancing the lifestyle experience.\r\n\r\nAt Stonehaven, you’ll experience refined living with exceptional comfort. These homes are designed to maximise light and space, with thoughtful layouts and energy-efficient features that promote sustainable, cost-effective living.\r\n\r\nFind the perfect blend of style, functionality, and modern comfort at Stonehaven. To book a viewing or for more information visit stonehavennaas.com."
      },
